{"_note":"拾光物语 ch3 comic pages, same format as mobile/story-comics-ch1.json. Crops are [x,y,w,h] fractions of the 1536x1024 level image.","chapter":"shiguang-ch3","levels":[{"timeLabel":"清晨","intro":"一大早，店门口落下一只好大的纸鹤。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"扑簌簌——"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"清晨，一只纸鹤落在了店门口。"}]},{"crop":[0.1302,0.0977,0.2214,0.332],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"咦？！"}]},{"crop":[0.5143,0.2148,0.1823,0.2539],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tl","text":"喵～"},{"kind":"caption","at":"br","text":"团子已经坐上去了。"}]},{"crop":[0.1953,0.4199,0.5859,0.4395],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这只纸鹤……是来接我们的？"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"上午","intro":"纸鹤一路往上飞，穿过了云。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"上午，云上出现了一座邮局。"}]},{"crop":[0.5599,0,0.3385,0.3906],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"信封像鸟一样，绕着钟楼飞。"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.4688,0.2083,0.3125],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"盯——"}]},{"crop":[0.2865,0.1172,0.651,0.4883],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"欢迎来到云上邮局，咕。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"中午","intro":"分拣室里，信堆得比人还高。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"中午，分拣室里堆满了旧信。"}]},{"crop":[0.4948,0.3516,0.3646,0.4883],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"扑通！"}]},{"crop":[0.5729,0,0.3125,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"有的信，等了好多好多年。"}]},{"crop":[0,0.1953,0.5208,0.3906],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"这些信，都没能寄到。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"午后","intro":"有一封信，封口是一朵粉色的小花。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"午后，一封信在桌上微微发光。"}]},{"crop":[0.4492,0.5078,0.2474,0.293],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"和小禾的发夹，一模一样。"}]},{"crop":[0.2474,0,0.2995,0.4492],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tr","text":"地址碎掉了，咕。"}]},{"crop":[0.1953,0.127,0.5339,0.4004],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"收信人……是我？"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"傍晚","intro":"把地址拼回来，信就能送到了。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"啪嗒。"},{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"傍晚，信的地址拼好了。"}]},{"crop":[0.2148,0,0.2474,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“给长大以后的小禾。”"}]},{"crop":[0.3646,0.166,0.2995,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"那只小猫……是团子？"}]},{"crop":[0.1693,0.3906,0.5469,0.4102],"texts":[{"kind":"say","at":"tl","text":"奶奶写这封信的时候，我才五岁。"}]}]}},{"timeLabel":"夜里","intro":"夜里的邮局，安安静静。","comic":{"panels":[{"crop":[0,0,1,1],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"夜里，小禾在阳台上读完了信。"}]},{"crop":[0.1628,0.2246,0.2474,0.3223],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"bl","text":"“小窝里最亮的那片拼图，是在海边捡到的。”"}]},{"crop":[0.3385,0.1465,0.2604,0.3516],"texts":[{"kind":"sfx","at":"tr","text":"咚！"},{"kind":"say","at":"bl","text":"回信，我帮你寄，咕。"}]},{"crop":[0.625,0.459,0.375,0.2813],"texts":[{"kind":"caption","at":"tl","text":"海面下，有什么在发着蓝光。"},{"kind":"say","at":"br","text":"下一站，月光水族馆。"}]}]}}]}